{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_peper_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_peper_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"少年雇傭兵","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_peper_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"8efdf1c15d4d047633342562dce5ffa7763352dc1884d754fbb06f21494d6942","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"明椒所在的雇傭兵小隊走在前往倫蒂尼姆的路上。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"沒走，還跟在後頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那丫頭多倔你又不是不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......替我再勸勸她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"老格林，我看你是真糊塗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"現在後悔，當時又何必帶著她出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"囉嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"黑市那單問題不小，兩頭的土豪都想整死對方，現在貨沒了，他們只會把這事甩在我們頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"要是不帶上臭丫頭，放城裡她會死得更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這我知道，但你現在趕她走，她也沒別的地去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......隨便在路上找個鎮子，能幹活總能有活路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這話你自己信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，為她好，你就該多練練她。她是不是都沒見過血？我是說真格的那種，不是宰兩頭角獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"老格林，別再做夢了，我們已經在去倫蒂尼姆的路上，以後這些都免不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"她也是個薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......行了，你少說兩句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這事我心裡有數。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，混蛋，大混蛋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又把我當小孩，遲早讓你後悔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"喲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！敵襲？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真是敵襲，現在你已經沒命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......什麼嘛，別嚇我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒閒到要來嚇你，是你警惕性太差，自己嚇自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是醫療人員，本來就沒那麼擅長戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且剛剛、剛剛是我在想事情，所以才沒有注意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，你說是就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，還在生老格林的氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，當然了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然在這種時候說要趕我走，你不覺得格林他過分嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是雇傭兵，我是小隊的成員，他為什麼要趕我走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不讓我和你們一起去倫蒂尼姆？明明我都跟隊出過那麼多次任務了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這次不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒看出有什麼特別的......要去的地方是有一點遠，不過報酬也很豐盛啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要說有什麼不一樣的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得格林那天回來，宣佈我們要立刻啟程的時候的樣子。我從沒見他那麼激動過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他平時好像對什麼都無所謂，但那時候不太一樣。他還說，只要這次打贏了，我們就能過上好日子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......誰知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想先拿到錢，其他的我沒想過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林總覺得我什麼都不懂，可我們雇傭兵不就是能賺到錢就好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能養活姥姥，幹什麼活不都一樣嘛。其他的，還要懂什麼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真能拿到那筆錢......我想替姥姥換個更好點的房子，現在住的地方下雨天會進水，奶奶總說膝蓋痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了，如果格林想要的話，我還能給他買點更好的生日禮物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在想著幫他過生日？他還記得自己哪天生這麼無聊的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡無聊了？明明很有意義啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不每年提醒一下自己，真的可能會忘記一年就這麼又過去了，忘記自己又長大一歲，又老去一歲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不覺得這還挺可怕的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......大概？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這算是什麼回答，好敷衍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我說不過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"依我看，你要是直接把這話說給格林本人聽，搞不好他就同意......不對，也有可能他就更不同意你跟著一起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？什麼意思......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（本來還想勸勸這丫頭......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。你就繼續跟著吧，我先回前頭去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛啊，最討厭說話說半截的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"神神秘秘的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"對方已經離開。前方的隊伍有大約二十人，明椒只能隱約看到最末尾的人的一道影子。\n女孩沉默片刻，垂下頭，從口袋裡掏出了什麼東西。\n那是一隻毛線織的，顏色鮮亮的指套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林肯定又要說顏色太亮了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼關係，就是要鮮豔一點才好看嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是再趕我走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就不把禮物給他了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼聲音？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......錯覺嗎？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人！出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打中了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是什麼人，有什麼目的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......別想跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追、追上你了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒想到會被個小姑娘發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那被小姑娘抓到的你又算什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經跑不掉了，快說！你是什麼人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，天真的小鬼。我承認你身手不錯，你們薩卡茲在這一行的名聲不虛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"但你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"腦袋空空的天真小鬼就算身手不錯，也只是小鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......不行，明椒，對方是故意在激怒你......不能中計，要冷靜下來......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我警告你，別想靠說廢話拖延時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點回答我的問題，否則我就要動手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"免費給你上一課，薩卡茲小鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我的問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"既然知道對方是在拖延時間，就不該繼續等下去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"說完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你和這小丫頭廢話真多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！你、你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"——動手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡！你們......卑鄙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，兩邊一起攻擊的話......躲不過去！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別閉眼！盯住對手，架起武器格擋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，麻煩的傢伙來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"別管其他人，盯緊你認準的獵物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不要怕受傷，戰鬥中永遠不要放開手裡的武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"別太小看人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在！攻擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈！說什麼別小看人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這句話該我說——你們這些混蛋，別太——小看我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，死小鬼，你在瞄準哪裡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你在幹什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我教你的都忘了嗎！攻擊敵人的要害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都收拾掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了嗎？我把這兩個混蛋都打趴下了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼了，你、你在生氣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前是怎麼教你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能輕敵，不能留手，對敵人要一擊致命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......剛剛我不是故意打偏的，只是，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是還有你在嘛，不會有問題的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"如果以後......如果我不在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是格林你怎麼會不在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒人能保證會一直在，別太天真了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市打手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都還活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......是的，我、我把他們打暈了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不直接殺了他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，不如我把他們綁起來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，他們就沒法通風報信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你看好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"上年紀的雇傭兵拔出腰間的利刃，在年輕人的注視下將其送入戰敗者的咽喉。\n赤紅的血濺落在明椒的護膝上，鞋面上，滾燙的熱度透過布料灼燒皮膚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是黑市的人，是衝著我們來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"如果剛剛我沒有察覺到這裡的動靜，今天這樣躺在這裡的就會是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道他們沒安好心！要不是格林你在，我剛剛就危險了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一個。他是我的獵物，我來了結他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要殺了他......對，我該殺了他。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（只要這樣刺下去，放輕鬆，明椒，這很簡單......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在猶豫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有猶豫......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我沒有猶豫......我是個雇傭兵，殺人而已......殺掉敵人而已！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這有什麼好猶豫的？我、我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就......現在就殺了他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？但是格林，我還沒有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你下不了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！你相信我......我可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本還什麼都不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"如果連這樣的人你都沒法下手，我可以斷言，你沒法繼續做雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你很快就會死。死在某個戰場上，這倒算是還不錯的結局了，你甚至可能死在一個無關緊要的地方，還得我去給你收屍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我就是雇傭兵啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這樣的雇傭兵總有一天都會死，這不是你說的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你我可不一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......格林，有的時候我會覺得很害怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像格林你說的那樣，今天倒在這的可能是我，如果格林你不在，我就會這樣被殺掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有可能會在很久之後才發現我，然後要等更長時間，在小鎮上的姥姥才會收到這個消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前弗雷德出事的時候，就是這樣。我一直記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"生離死別是常事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我知道，你經常這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怕死，真的不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我怕有一天我真的回不去了，姥姥卻還一直等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次就這麼算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林......！不，等等，我真的可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我看夠鬧劇了，所以到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"但是臭丫頭，你記住了，要是繼續跟著我們走下去，你總還會遇到必須要動手的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你明白？我看不見得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣或許會害了你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"別去倫蒂尼姆了，你不合適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格林你不是說，只要這次能打贏，我們就能有好日子過了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能戰鬥，我一定可以幫上忙的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這不光是戰鬥的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我會把我的一切壓在這次的任務上，那是因為我曾經見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見過什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過我們薩卡茲有家的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"也許沒那麼好，但只要有一點可能，我就願意拼一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"可你不同。你還能有選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我的選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了跟著大家一起，我還能去哪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想回小鎮，繼續像之前一樣過日子，可是......我們真的能嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我有想過的，這次去倫蒂尼姆的任務，比之前的所有任務都要難，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未來有一天，可能格林你也會倒在什麼地方，就這麼丟了命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我就不給你準備明年的生日禮物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你，今年的禮物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......指套？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不許說太鮮豔！不許說浪費時間！不許說不需要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你要是死掉，我是不會傷心的，我保證。對我們薩卡茲來說，生離死別不算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果可以不死......不管是被狠狠揍一頓也好，還是拿不到報酬也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣都行。白跑一趟賺不到錢也沒什麼，我都不介意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我希望在任務結束之後，大家還能一起回來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......天真的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的年輕人難道都像你這麼天真？我知道的薩卡茲不該這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼又罵我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道薩卡茲就不能希望身邊的人都平安了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我就是這麼想的......我就是薩卡茲啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的薩卡茲總會死在戰場上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可不想看到你的死相，臭丫頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格林","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思......哎，等等我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
